Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.56,0:00:12.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助的眼中再次浮现出神秘画面……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:17.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那是哥哥以前看过的景象
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:22.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,梦人已经策划了两起犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:27.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,借助神秘的左眼 爱之助试图与哥哥对抗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:32.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼侦探EYE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.06,0:00:39.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥策划的连环绑架案开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:44.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第一起案件中 犯人派了狗去取100万日元的赎金
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.05,0:00:48.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第二起案件中 被绑架的八岁女孩的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:52.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没能筹齐所需的400万日元
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:54.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,尽管钱不够
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.04,0:00:56.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,她还是把钱绑在鸽子身上放飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.04,0:00:58.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人借口钱不够
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:01.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把小舞留在了危险的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:05.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:08.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这次会换成别的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:12.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多亏了左眼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.11,0:01:15.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我推断出了小舞所在的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:19.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接着 救下小舞的是……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.64,0:01:22.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一名警察
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:24.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.99,0:01:27.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.19,0:01:31.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:35.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真正的较量现在才要开始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.63,0:01:41.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第2集
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:45.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你真的把密码解开了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:49.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让我好好解了闷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:55.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不愧是犯罪天才
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.63,0:02:08.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:09.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在把笔记本电脑交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:13.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我又重新设了防
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:15.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.69,0:02:19.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我有一个条件
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.13,0:02:27.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,放我出去 再给我一把枪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.57,0:02:31.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让我能杀人 而且不用再坐牢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:34.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了！我绝不可能答应！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.40,0:02:38.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你确定你现在的处境能对我说这种话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.50,0:02:42.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绑架还会继续
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:03.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凛 我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.89,0:03:14.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,该怎么办呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.66,0:03:18.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,或许大家还没察觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.12,0:03:21.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但实际上已经发生了3起绑架
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.36,0:03:27.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果你把我的事告诉任何人 第三名人质就会死
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:43.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我回来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.61,0:03:48.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听说绑架案还在继续？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:52.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,先是用了狗 然后是鸽子 接着是海狮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:55.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人掌控了陆海空啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.02,0:03:59.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,想出这个计划的人真是个天才
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:03.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,实际上已经发生了3起绑架
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.61,0:04:07.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好痛……好痛好痛好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.32,0:04:08.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.77,0:04:10.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从昨晚开始肚子就有点痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:14.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.73,0:04:19.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我这就去给你拿点东西 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.19,0:04:21.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 您还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:25.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.67,0:04:31.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是最好的药
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.57,0:04:40.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哇 溶解了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.62,0:04:43.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:47.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你差不多该去上学了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:48.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:52.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请大家看第62页的例题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.49,0:04:56.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在左眼看到的画面中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:05:00.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个……还有这个我已经弄明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.97,0:05:04.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有这个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.69,0:05:10.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“M会死” 这里的M肯定是指小舞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.63,0:05:14.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那么 还没弄明白的……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:17.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就是这个……还有……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:18.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.57,0:05:27.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 我想问您点事……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:36.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树 你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.09,0:05:38.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没什么 只是有点贫血
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.30,0:05:41.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,记得要好好吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:45.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:47.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:56.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要还清所有债务……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,竟然要花15年？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.54,0:06:00.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.65,0:06:03.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 我的人生全完了……
- 老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哎呀 爱之助 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:07.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别「哦」我啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:10.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 这里是保健室 我是狭山
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.06,0:06:12.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是YY金融的谷田部
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.64,0:06:22.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,身为保健老师欠了这么大一笔债 不觉得害臊吗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:28.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我可不想去你家贴满“欠债还钱”的讨债单
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.59,0:06:30.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:32.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会还的！我一定会还的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:35.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然需要一点时间 但我会有悬赏金收入的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.18,0:06:35.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:38.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会还的！我保证！请别再打电话来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:47.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:01.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.74,0:07:04.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:11.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打扰了 我感觉好多了 先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:13.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别太勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.35,0:07:15.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树 一起走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.95,0:07:22.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对了 听说昨天又发生了一起绑架案
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.79,0:07:25.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早间新闻里播了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:28.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好像是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:31.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.77,0:07:36.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那次是你报的警吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.71,0:07:39.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看到鸽子之后 你说了一句奇怪的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.95,0:07:43.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,果然 鸽子是指下一起绑架案吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:51.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能告诉我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.29,0:07:55.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么这么问？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:57.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:08:02.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我只是无法原谅那个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.07,0:08:05.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,专门伤害穷人的犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:10.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那种人不配活在世上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:12.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:19.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但幕后黑手到底是谁呢……？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.26,0:08:26.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我觉得不止一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:32.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算不是 那个人也更没有活着的资格
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:40.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,千万别告诉任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.93,0:08:45.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.26,0:08:49.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有时候我的直觉会告诉我……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.90,0:08:53.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你觉得这个怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:56.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看起来像鸽子……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:09:02.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但我之前看到的鸽子要更清晰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:06.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这里面有些东西让我很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.78,0:09:10.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:14.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我猜也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:19.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好吧 我家在那边……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.47,0:09:21.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.31,0:09:31.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,话说 难道……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.35,0:09:32.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:36.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道你……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:52.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:15.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,梦人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:22.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,顺便说一下 第三起绑架案来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.45,0:10:26.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你不是说已经发生过了吗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:28.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那是骗你的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.07,0:10:33.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是不这么做 你就会把我的事告诉别人了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:38.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,作为补偿 我送你一份礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:41.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:47.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是专门为你准备的奖励关卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.05,0:10:50.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等！哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.99,0:10:52.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:55.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,受害者是海藤正树 15岁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.33,0:10:57.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他遭到袭击 被强行拽上了车
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:11:00.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目击者是他同校的朋友田中爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:01.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又是那个中学生……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:04.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他没能记下车牌号
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:06.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也没看清犯人的长相 因为对方戴着面具
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.87,0:11:09.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,受害者家里只有母亲一人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.33,0:11:11.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,海藤早苗 35岁 上门护理员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.88,0:11:13.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,索要的赎金是——
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:15.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,900万日元
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:17.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目前还没有交付赎金的具体指示
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.39,0:11:18.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:22.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但要求的金额实在太大 家属可能筹不齐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:24.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为了避免人质像上次那样陷入危险
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.87,0:11:27.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们警方能不能在赎金上提供一点支援？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.23,0:11:30.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,规定就是规定
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.78,0:11:33.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警方绝不能向犯人提供资金
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:33.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.82,0:11:35.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人的目的到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:42.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.16,0:11:45.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,900万日元数额太大了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:49.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树身体本来就弱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.74,0:11:53.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再这样下去他会没命的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:57.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求你们 救救他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.07,0:12:00.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了！求求你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:08.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们很遗憾 但按规定赎金必须由家属筹集
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:15.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这么说 你们是要对穷人家的孩子见死不救吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.53,0:12:17.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.37,0:12:19.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能理解您的心情 但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.34,0:12:31.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,900万日元……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.22,0:12:38.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样……那么大一笔钱……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.33,0:12:40.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打扰了……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:43.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.60,0:12:47.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他是案件的目击者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.38,0:12:50.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是正树在学校的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:54.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是狭山 保健老师
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:58.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想请问一下……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:13:01.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您认识一位姓神谷的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:08.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,神谷先生是我工作公司的社长
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:27.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我儿子是我唯一宝贵的依靠
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:32.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求您 救救他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.93,0:13:36.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我理解您的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:46.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是 如果遇到这种事每次都帮员工垫钱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:50.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯罪分子就会没完没了地盯上我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:53.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您看这次能不能破个例……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:14:00.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,以我的收入 根本不可能筹到900万日元
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.57,0:14:03.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求您了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.29,0:14:11.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,神谷社长 不如我们做个交易吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:12.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:14.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果您这次伸出援手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.61,0:14:21.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警方会通过媒体向神谷公司公开表达谢意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:24.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:30.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要能抓住犯人并追回这900万日元
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:31.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就没有理由拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.38,0:14:34.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然 我以警察的尊严担保
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:36.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.42,0:14:38.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.53,0:14:51.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真是太感谢您了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:56.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.30,0:14:58.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.52,0:15:00.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.61,0:15:08.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人好像把指示信和附带的袋子寄到了受害者家里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:13.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要求把900万日元装进袋子里 明天上午10点送过去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:14.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是指名人质的母亲去送吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:20.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,信上说 必须由受害者的朋友田中爱之助去送
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.08,0:15:25.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:27.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.31,0:15:31.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,电话监听已就绪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.89,0:15:33.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好 下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:35.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,发信器检查完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.47,0:15:36.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好 下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:40.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,田中爱之助的公寓已由A组负责监视
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.56,0:15:42.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所有人原地待命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.80,0:15:43.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.64,0:15:44.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:52.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:54.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.91,0:15:59.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树就在我眼前被抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:02.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而我却什么都做不了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:03.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.66,0:16:06.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.10,0:16:09.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么指名让我去送赎金？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.95,0:16:13.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想不通哥哥的目的到底是什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.39,0:16:18.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他一直都比我聪明得多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.69,0:16:23.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我怎么可能赢得了他？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.58,0:16:28.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实变聪明很简单的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:30.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.11,0:16:33.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要换个角度看问题就行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:38.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,换个角度看这些绑架案……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:44.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这些案件的另一面……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:55.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还是不明白……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:17:00.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所有人0800前就位！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.16,0:17:00.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,以上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:01.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:12.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,田中爱之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:18.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,调查结束了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:19.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:38.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:40.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.48,0:17:42.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.46,0:17:50.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加油啊 爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.03,0:17:54.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过居然要900万日元啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:29.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:31.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是田中爱之助吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.61,0:18:33.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.71,0:18:37.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在路上别往包里看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:41.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,免得被人看到钱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.59,0:18:53.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对了 你有兄弟姐妹吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.31,0:18:57.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有个哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.61,0:18:59.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哦 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:02.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他是个怎样的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.24,0:19:06.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他非常聪明 人也很好……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:10.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.74,0:19:12.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.44,0:19:16.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哎呀 真遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.29,0:19:20.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过就算是好人……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.27,0:19:23.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,迟早也都会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:26.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,附近的车站有投币式储物柜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.49,0:19:30.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接下来的指示在12号柜子里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.72,0:19:34.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果30分钟内赶不到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.42,0:19:38.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你就准备跟你的朋友说永别吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:51.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,电话监听怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:52.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,情况不对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.68,0:19:54.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有设备屏蔽了信号 我们无法破解拦截
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.27,0:19:56.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是从哪里打来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.99,0:19:58.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目前还无法确定
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:20:00.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,信号先绕到海外中转 所以无法追踪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:12.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等！这是我的柜子！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.74,0:20:20.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你干什么？干嘛吓人啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.99,0:20:27.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我得赶快！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.69,0:21:28.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉了 加藤先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:34.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,甩掉跟踪你的人 去清风公园
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.33,0:21:39.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要有一个人跟着你 游戏就结束了 
把他们甩掉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.28,0:22:00.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,变装原来这么简单啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.28,0:22:12.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这位女士！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.92,0:22:15.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还差30日元
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.02,0:22:17.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我赶时间
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.59,0:22:20.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刚才出去的那个男生是我的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.22,0:22:24.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我必须跟上他！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.84,0:22:30.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！爱之助！借我30日元！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.61,0:22:33.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起 老师
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.41,0:22:43.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是福地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.48,0:22:45.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？跟丢了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.28,0:22:48.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,追踪发信器的信号
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.44,0:22:51.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 向指挥部汇报情况 
- 是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.36,0:23:01.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 福地警视 恕我冒昧 但我有点在意一件事 
- 什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.63,0:23:09.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果这次也是利用动物的犯人 会不会这次也打算用动物？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.76,0:23:13.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我们是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.21,0:23:15.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 跑了！
- 加藤先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.34,0:23:21.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭山老师！你怎么在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.68,0:23:24.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 能借我30日元吗？
- 啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.98,0:23:29.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 爱之助！
- 加藤先生！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.70,0:24:03.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 赶得不错 
- 这到底还要持续多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.22,0:24:08.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看到长椅旁边的垃圾桶了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.85,0:24:13.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,去里面看看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.89,0:24:34.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,去河边 限你20分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.34,0:25:06.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来你赶上了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.19,0:25:21.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你应该看到码头了吧 坐上橡皮艇 解开锁 然后一直往前划
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.93,0:26:39.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.97,0:26:54.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,海上的感觉不错吧？可以不用划了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.14,0:27:00.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在大声拍4下手
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.34,0:27:30.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 出现动物了 是海豚 
- 果然是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.21,0:27:34.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,留在原地等待进一步指示
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.42,0:27:45.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果陆地上是狗 天空是鸽子 那这次轮到水里也是顺理成章的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.97,0:27:55.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把钱交给海豚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.32,0:28:00.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把包绑在圆环上
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.25,0:28:58.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.69,0:29:03.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？
- 没受伤吧？都还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.30,0:29:11.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 你们怎么知道我在这儿？
- 福地警官说你可能会来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.16,0:29:24.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,海豚游走了 包沉在水底 我们捞上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.83,0:29:29.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？那就是说900万日元还在里面？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.26,0:29:33.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.68,0:29:36.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.54,0:29:38.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.34,0:29:41.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,包拿到了 但钱不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.32,0:29:48.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好……知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.15,0:29:55.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 福地警官想问你几个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.53,0:30:00.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 什么？
- 他认为只有你才有可能把钱拿走
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.95,0:30:04.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.93,0:30:13.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你就是田中爱之助吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.40,0:30:23.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我什么都没做 只是按照犯人的指示去送赎金而已
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.95,0:30:29.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好像跟犯人通了电话
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.87,0:30:35.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道你认识犯人？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.12,0:30:37.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.49,0:30:40.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别撒谎了 没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.23,0:30:48.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果你把我的事告诉任何人 第三名人质就会死
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.65,0:30:52.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我真的什么都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.05,0:31:04.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可能是因为他知道我帮着救了小舞……所以怀恨在心
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.30,0:31:09.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可去送钱的人明明就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.00,0:31:17.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且跟犯人通话的也是你 你自己就没想过会被怀疑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.73,0:31:24.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助绝对不可能是犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.38,0:31:28.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警察全是一群笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.72,0:31:36.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,既然这样 我一定要证明爱之助的清白
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.62,0:31:40.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能帮上什么忙呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.00,0:31:49.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,画的复印件有时候能派上大用场
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.56,0:31:55.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这座雕像在之前的案件里还没出现过……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.70,0:32:03.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人到底是谁？你把钱藏到哪儿去了？又是怎么藏的？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.23,0:32:10.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在你说出实话之前 谁都不会放你走的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.61,0:32:25.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果你涉案 那就说明赎金为100万和400万日元的前两起绑架案也跟你有关 对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.24,0:32:43.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没错 我左眼看到的那些平方 可能和赎金数额有关
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.76,0:32:52.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,10的平方是100 20的平方是400 30的平方是900 
很有可能 因为哥哥很喜欢数学
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.46,0:32:56.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要换个角度看问题就行
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.10,0:32:59.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,换个角度看那个聪明人……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.74,0:33:14.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道说？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.67,0:33:30.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 如果我抓到真正的犯人 你们能相信我是清白的吗？
- 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.80,0:33:37.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.25,0:33:55.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来M指的是正树
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.21,0:34:02.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.02,0:34:08.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 正树有生命危险！
- 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.48,0:34:11.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有一个人可能把钱拿走
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.77,0:34:13.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.82,0:34:15.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,报告！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.79,0:34:20.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人联系了人质的母亲 说已经拿到钱了 明天就会把儿子送回来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.54,0:34:25.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 不 来不及了！再不采取行动 正树就会死！
- 明明是你自己把钱交给犯人的！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.92,0:34:35.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生 快打电话给狭山老师 把我画的那座雕像发给她 正树肯定就在那附近
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.20,0:34:40.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不对 不是这张……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.10,0:34:47.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是这个吗？找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.32,0:34:53.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树应该在1106号房间
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.72,0:34:59.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 狭山老师？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.43,0:35:08.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 明白了 我这就转告他 
她说那座雕像在“Sea West酒店”旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.35,0:35:10.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.22,0:35:17.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求您放我走吧 之后您就全明白了 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.17,0:35:26.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好吧 快去
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.61,0:35:50.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.52,0:35:54.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 正树！
- 爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.83,0:35:58.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.69,0:36:08.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 加藤先生 拿毛巾来 
好！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.48,0:36:11.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,海藤 撑住啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.00,0:36:13.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,海藤！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.46,0:36:16.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 海藤 你怎么样？
- 我去向领导汇报
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.82,0:36:21.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 像这样按住
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.92,0:36:26.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 加藤先生……
- 正树！正树！千万别死啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.06,0:36:31.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树！别死啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.34,0:36:51.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.55,0:36:56.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树他受了伤 现在在医院
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.98,0:37:00.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？怎么可能……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.26,0:37:05.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没错 本不该这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.86,0:37:16.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果他的母亲不是犯人 正树根本就不会出事
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.36,0:37:25.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您只是想让自己和正树过上好日子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.13,0:37:35.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我向警方争取了5分钟的时间跟您谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.50,0:37:47.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狗和鸽子其实都只是幌子
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.26,0:37:52.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从一开始 您的目标就是那900万日元
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.98,0:38:00.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,利用动物 是为了在最后这起案子里把警方的注意力全引到海豚身上
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.72,0:38:17.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在把钱放进包里之前 您就换成了溶于水的假币
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.42,0:38:24.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,胡说八道 你有证据吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.28,0:38:34.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是我在正树那里找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.68,0:38:47.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树在自己家里发现了一根白色羽毛 就是第二起绑架案里用到的鸽子的羽毛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.75,0:38:59.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树本想相信自己的妈妈 但被绑架后 他就明白幕后主使是谁了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.29,0:39:04.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以 在他来到酒店之后……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.57,0:39:14.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,妈妈 对不起……都是我的错……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.41,0:39:20.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果没有我 这一切就不会发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.69,0:39:25.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,傻孩子 别这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.29,0:39:33.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树！正树！正树！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.91,0:39:39.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请您自首吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.39,0:39:43.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,说出真相吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.54,0:39:50.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凭您一个人 根本策划不出这一切吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.83,0:39:57.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我真的能拿到900万日元吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.35,0:40:05.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的 而且绝不会有人死伤
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.30,0:40:12.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一切都交由我们来安排
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.28,0:40:24.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然 绑架你儿子的时候 我们自有全盘计划
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.02,0:40:37.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个到时候应该能派上用场
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.42,0:41:13.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.42,0:41:44.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们该不会又被耍了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.37,0:41:48.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不 我们已经抓到犯人了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.39,0:41:55.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我看事情没那么简单 是他们故意让人抓到的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.37,0:42:01.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个犯罪天才利用人性的弱点在操纵他们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.39,0:42:09.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过 我总觉得你其实并没有解开那台电脑的密码
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.82,0:42:19.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,婚礼 犯罪计划 赎金……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.43,0:42:21.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.38,0:42:30.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这一系列的绑架 不过是为真正的犯罪做准备罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.24,0:42:43.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真没想到妈妈竟然会为了我去犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.97,0:42:47.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.62,0:43:02.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,错不在你 错的是那些利用你妈妈的人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.94,0:43:19.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然这么说可能有点奇怪 但我一定会替你讨回公道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.10,0:43:22.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.11,0:43:36.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会抓住毁掉你们生活的人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.69,0:43:54.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 你要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.08,0:44:07.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我有重要的事情必须告诉福地警视和加藤
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.56,0:44:12.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是关于绑架案的事
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.01,0:44:15.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,关于绑架案？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.36,0:44:23.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实策划这一连串绑架案的……是我哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.11,0:44:46.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不要！音濑先生！音濑先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.88,0:44:50.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快叫救护车！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.56,0:44:56.33,SongTop,,0,0,0,,即使眼中映出的世界满是悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.77,0:44:55.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,音濑先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.38,0:44:58.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快叫救护车！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.55,0:45:02.92,SongTop,,0,0,0,,我们的青春物语也绝不再逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.01,0:45:10.91,SongTop,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 一定能寻找到光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.01,0:45:18.84,SongTop,,0,0,0,,因为想看到泪水过后的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.94,0:45:25.64,SongTop,,0,0,0,,就算对未来感到不安 也不要敷衍逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.89,0:45:32.17,SongTop,,0,0,0,,不要对自己说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.46,0:45:39.63,SongTop,,0,0,0,,纵然迷茫 迷茫 再迷茫 依然怀揣梦想 追逐梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.79,0:45:46.50,SongTop,,0,0,0,,坚信这份心意终能传达 直到实现
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.62,0:45:54.61,SongTop,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 我们一定能寻找到光芒
